# CSS conventions

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full context. Style reference: sibling project **darter**.

## Layers

1. Tokens in `:root` (`--spacing-*`, `--gap-*`, colors)
2. Utilities in section 3 Layout (`.flex`, `.grid`, `.gap-*`, `.text-color-*`)
3. Component CSS only where utilities are insufficient

## Naming

- No BEM (`__` or `--` in class names).
- Modifiers: extra classes — `.pill.choice`, `li.featured`, `ul.history`.
- Nest elements: `.story-item .body`, `.settings-segment label > span.button`.

## Spacing

Use `var(--spacing-*)` and gap utilities. Do not tokenize:

- Translation popover close + `.curve` sizes
- Nav clearance (`12rem`, iOS popover offsets)
- `calc(... - 1px)` border offsets, shadows

## HTML layout

Prefer utilities over new one-off flex/gap blocks:

```html
<div class="flex columns gap-small">
```

Bump `?v=` in `head.php` / `scripts.php` when changing CSS.
